제10장 가정의 산출방법
10-4. (위험률)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
