10-2. (사업비율)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
