제9장 할인율 가정"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
